			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2691721">
									

<p>I think AWCY? articles come from a certain kind of &quot;meanness&quot; against the normies. Even the &quot;more playful&quot; AWCY? articles are still arrogant and pretentious. They're much more interested in letting you know how smart they are than anything else. They're amoral.</p>
<p>I look at GAW as being a group with a heart that is ultimately in it for the joke. It's not fun to have completely amoral trolls. I want a cast of anomalous internet shitposters who actually have real human connections with people and want to foster goodness in the world, however way they see it. But, like, still, at the end of the day, they're married to the joke, and they don't take themselves as deathly seriously as AWCY? does.</p>

							</div>

								
